{"title":"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Lazy,_but_kind_of_intuitive)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Lazy, but kind of intuitive)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf2756b7e9bb76b2adf76f1709cc765535b27602.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"112\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e12822d4d418ef37b7ca03cff39d5b6e8123508.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\sqrt{x}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\sqrt[3]{x^{2}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\sqrt[27]{x^{2}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\sqrt[54]{x}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\sqrt[81]{x^{80}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"473\" height=\"22\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b532d915bdc855d96cfa266d7d3bb9a168fd803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}=\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt{x})^{2}\\cdot\\sqrt{x}}=\\sqrt[3]{(\\sqrt{x})^{3}}=\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"322\" height=\"33\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/6/7a6a1831eb969273f9c00ce0ca3ba2e52d2b5c72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}}}=\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}}=\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}= \\sqrt{x} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"446\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/279577b98d2f0150723f2f0515956c7644b64f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}} = \\sqrt[3]{x\\cdot(x^\\frac{1}{2})} = \\sqrt[3]{x^\\frac{3}{2}} = x^\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"261\" height=\"33\" /> We plug this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf2756b7e9bb76b2adf76f1709cc765535b27602.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt{x}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"112\" height=\"53\" /> and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a99fffd0d716670d45d3670d720ce5a2759b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\sqrt[3]{x\\cdot(x^\\frac{1}{2})}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"106\" height=\"43\" />. Again, we substitute and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b1adbd26fb38c3122623b411b4ac95ec22a10d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x\\cdot(x^\\frac{1}{2})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"77\" height=\"32\" />. We substitute one more time and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1776fe56fd8aca62634dae2e4c3810f6efc04159.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^\\frac{1}{2} = \\boxed{(A) \\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"110\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Lazy.2C_but_kind_of_intuitive.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Lazy,_but_kind_of_intuitive)\">Solution 3 (Lazy, but kind of intuitive)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Lazy, but kind of intuitive)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, plug in some random square number like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the output you get after simplifying the expression will always be the square root of the number, so the answer is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/551a3120d6f0aaf730bc5c423202ae8e0b5a6353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(A) \\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>~Darth_Cadet\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Substitution)\">Solution 3 (Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09321f3751bf85c830a8aabd84cd4e07eed40f99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />. The expression then turns into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/2615a06153cedd821a2f41c41e2a8fdc44db074f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{y^2\\sqrt[3]{y^2\\sqrt[3]{y^2\\sqrt{y^2}}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"143\" height=\"56\" />. Notice that for each cube root we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31de8861a152b7a264b710786c076cba6da856aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{y^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"24\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, so our final answer is simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, or equivalently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/551a3120d6f0aaf730bc5c423202ae8e0b5a6353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(A) \\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>~BlueAnglerfish42\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8DMxo2pi1h8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8DMxo2pi1h8</a>  ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A\">2003 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b